    "widget_8": {
      "uri": "widgets/common/text/",
      "version": "1.19.0",
      "icon": {
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path fill=\"#000\" d=\"M8 5.5a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M6.5 7.5A.5.5 0 0 1 7 7h1.5v4.5h1a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h1V8H7a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5\"></path><path fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8 16A8 8 0 1 1 8 0a8 8 0 0 1 0 16m0-1A7 7 0 1 0 8 1a7 7 0 0 0 0 14\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>",
        "properties": {
          "filename": "InfoOutlined",
          "originalName": "outlined/suggested/info.svg",
          "path": [
            "suggested",
            "InfoOutlined"
          ],
          "inlineSvg": true,
          "isUploaded": false,
          "color": ""
        }
      },
      "label": "About",
      "config": {
        "text": "<p>This map estimates existing shade within a user-selected area by combining tree canopy and building shade at 3 PM. Tree canopy data comes from the USDA Forest Service Tree Canopy Cover dataset. Building footprints and height information come from Overture Maps, and building shadows are calculated using solar position from the pvlib Python library. Building footprints are excluded so the result represents actual shaded ground.</p><p><br></p><p>Sources: <a href=\"https://data.fs.usda.gov/geodata/rastergateway/treecanopycover/\" target=\"_blank\" data-uniqueid=\"0bf5ec47_1375_81bd_7cdd_a79ec0f3c155\" data-dsid=\"\" data-link=\"%7B%22linkType%22%3A%22WEB_ADDRESS%22%2C%22openType%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdata.fs.usda.gov%2Fgeodata%2Frastergateway%2Ftreecanopycover%2F%22%2C%22expression%22%3Anull%7D\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">USDA Forest Service Tree Canopy Cover </a>- <a href=\"https://overturemaps.org/\" target=\"_blank\" data-uniqueid=\"ed565b15_9ba1_7638_d1ea_d1a31e513aed\" data-dsid=\"\" data-link=\"%7B%22linkType%22%3A%22WEB_ADDRESS%22%2C%22openType%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Foverturemaps.org%2F%22%2C%22expression%22%3Anull%7D\">Overture Maps</a> - <a href=\"https://pvlib-python.readthedocs.io/en/stable/\" target=\"_blank\" data-uniqueid=\"f05fc38b_1776_4d74_9b4c_3c440dab6756\" data-dsid=\"\" data-link=\"%7B%22linkType%22%3A%22WEB_ADDRESS%22%2C%22openType%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fpvlib-python.readthedocs.io%2Fen%2Fstable%2F%22%2C%22expression%22%3Anull%7D\">pvlib</a></p>",
        "placeholder": "Double click to edit text",
        "style": {
          "wrap": true
        }
      },
